ind":"announcement","title":"Grove of the Seven Stones – A World of Adventure Awaits!","summary":"⚔️ Grove of the Seven Stones – A World of Adventure Awaits! Plus an Upcoming RPGWatch Interview!Hello, adventurers!With the release of Grove of the Seven Stones approaching on November 13, 2026, I wanted to take a moment to share some of the things players can look forward to when they begin their adventure!I'm also excited to announce that I've recently completed an interview for RPGWatch, where I discuss the development of Grove of the Seven Stones, my inspirations, the lessons I've learned as","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:18:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029220","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:57:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1837955055359156","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update – German & Chinese Complete!","summary":"Hello everyone!I wanted to share a quick development update on Grove of the Seven Stones.I'm happy to announce that the German and Simplified Chinese localizations have now been completed! These translations are a major step toward making the game accessible to more players around the world.I'm also continuing to work on additional language support and hope to bring even more translations to the game before release.A huge thank you to everyone who has supported the project, offered feedback, and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-11T11:49:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055359156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1836506165581700","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gameplay Video Now Available!","summary":"Hello everyone!I've just added a brand-new gameplay video to the Steam store page for Grove of the Seven Stones!While the original trailer showcases the world and atmosphere of Grove, this new video focuses on actual gameplay, giving you a much better look at exploration and combat, and the overall experience you'll have when you begin your adventure.I wanted to provide a closer look at the game as development continues and show some of the many improvements that have been made over the past sev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T21:13:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1836506165574216","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Temporarily Offline for a Rebuild & Polish Pass","summary":"Hello everyone,First, I want to sincerely thank everyone who downloaded and tried the Grove of the Seven Stones demo. Seeing so many players give the game a chance means a lot to me.After watching the early response and taking some time to look closely at the demo, I’ve decided to temporarily take it offline so I can rebuild and polish it properly. I want the demo to better represent the true vision of the game: a classic fantasy CRPG with exploration, dangerous dungeons, tactical combat, charac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T16:32:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165574216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1836506165565996","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update – Bringing Grove to More Players","summary":"Hello everyone!I wanted to share a quick development update. Alongside continuing work on the full release of Grove of the Seven Stones, I've also begun working on localizing the game into additional languages.The first languages currently in development are German, Russian, Chinese. They are being translated as the game is being developed. Every item, weapon, armor, spell, menu, quest, and piece of dialogue is being carefully localized so that players can enjoy the world of Grove in their own l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T16:58:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1836506165558877","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"announcement","title":"Surprise! The Grove of the Seven Stones demo is available now!","summary":"I originally planned to release it on July 6th, but after wrapping up the final polish, I decided not to keep everyone waiting.If you love classic CRPGs like Might & Magic, Wizardry, and Ultima, I'd love for you to give it a try.Every bit of feedback helps make the full game even better.Download the demo, explore the Grove, and if you enjoy it, please consider adding the game to your Wishlist.Thank you for all the support!— Mystic Dream Studios","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T21:57:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165558877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1836506165546423","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"update","title":"Grove of the Seven Stones Development Update","summary":"Greetings Adventurers,I wanted to share a quick development update and let everyone know that Grove of the Seven Stones is making excellent progress.Over the past several weeks I've been hard at work polishing the game, improving quests, refining the combat system, expanding dungeons, and continuing to fill the world with new characters, enemies, and secrets to discover. The project has come a long way, and I'm extremely excited with how everything is coming together.One of the biggest improveme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T16:02:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4798730-1835871199301841","game_id":"steam-4798730","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Demo Release","summary":"Hello everyone!I’m excited to announce that the official demo for Grove of the Seven Stones will be released on July 6th.As many of you know, my first game was The Traveller Tale. While I’m proud of what I accomplished with my first release, I also learned a tremendous amount from that experience. I listened carefully to player feedback, paid attention to what worked, what didn’t, and what players were truly looking for in a classic RPG experience.Grove of the Seven Stones is the result of those","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T20:08:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199301841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4798730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:28:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:28:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4798730":"2026-10-26T14:28:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4798730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:28:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:28:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":